      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "•  Checkout takes 1.4 s at p95; payments is 70% of it\n\n•  Most retries come from expired card tokens\n\n•  Guest checkout converts 12% better than sign-in\n\n•  Mobile users abandon at the payment step twice as often",
      "fontSize": 34,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "•  Checkout takes 1.4 s at p95; payments is 70% of it\n\n•  Most retries come from expired card tokens\n\n•  Guest checkout converts 12% better than sign-in\n\n•  Mobile users abandon at the payment step twice as often",
